A braced comment does not decide a quote

```
\{"q"
.
<p>{“q”</p>
```

```
\{{%%}"q"
.
<p>{“q”</p>
```

```
{%%}"q"
.
<p>“q”</p>
```

```
x {% hidden %}"q"
.
<p>x “q”</p>
```

```
a{%%}"q"
.
<p>a”q”</p>
```

```
[x]{.c}{%%}"q"
.
<p><span class="c">x</span>”q”</p>
```

```
\{{%%}'q'
.
<p>{‘q’</p>
```
